    <string name="privacy_about_label">How your data is handled</string>
    <string name="privacy_about_body">The kill switch blocks every outbound request at a single chokepoint. With it on, Domain AI is completely offline.\n\nCloud mode must be allowed before any message can leave your device, and redaction strips emails, phone numbers, card numbers and similar from a prompt before it is sent. Each cloud reply shows you the exact redacted text that was sent.\n\nSome free cloud models log or train on prompts. Those stay unavailable unless you allow them.\n\nCrash reports are off by default and never contain conversation content. Domain AI has no analytics and no trackers, and your conversations are encrypted on this device with a hardware-backed key.</string>
